OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fthis evening across the south with a
OL,7,Fmix of cloud and clear spells. Cloud
OL,8,Ffeeding into some areas further north,
OL,9,Fwith the odd spot of rain possible,
OL,10,Fthis most likely over higher ground.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start in the south,
OL,13,Fbut cloudier skies further north
OL,14,Fmoving southwards throughout the day,
OL,15,Falthough some brighter periods still
OL,16,Fpossible. Some showers possible,
OL,17,Fespecially in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
