OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining changeable with a band of
OL,7,Frain crossing the region on Wednesday.
OL,8,FA return to drier and brighter weather
OL,9,Ffrom Thursday with plenty of sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Temperatures near average.
